<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Njeri_Rionge">Njeri Rionge</a> (1966–2023) , technology entrepreneur who was a co-founder of the Internet Service Provider (ISP) Wananchi Online Limited (WOL)</li>
<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnny_Rozsa">Johnny Rozsa</a>, photographer</li>
<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel_Somen">Israel Somen</a> (1903–1984), <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayor_of_Nairobi">Mayor of Nairobi</a></li>
<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonathan_Somen">Jonathan Somen</a> (born 1969), co-founder of Access Kenya Group</li>
<li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdi_Salim">Abdi Salim</a> (born 2001), Somali footballer</li>
